--[[
    HollowLib v3.0 – 1up API + Red/Dark Theme + Tall/Narrow + Transparent + Blur
    Features: Global Chat, ESP Preview, Background Texture, Keybind List, Watermark, Notifications
    Fully compatible with all 1up scripts – drop-in replacement.
]]

